                                "sense_id": "cbc74eb8-32a9-3832-b0ae-227e92b32a5a",
                                "text": "The ring obtained after the adjunction of the elements a,b and y to the ring R may be denoted R#91;a,b,y#93;."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3e9af145-9ad5-4597-a5dc-abe677b76bf3",
                                "sense_id": "cbc74eb8-32a9-3832-b0ae-227e92b32a5a",
                                "text": "The field adjunction #92;mathbb#123;Q#125;(#92;pi) can be obtained from #92;mathbb#123;Q#125; by adjoining #92;pi to #92;mathbb#123;Q#125;."
                            }
                        ]
